I.. ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION OF ITEMS TO BE DISCUSSED IN CLOSED SESSION

1) CONFERENCE WITH REAL PROPERTY NEGOTIATORS     
    (Government Code Section 54956.8)    

    Property:     
    1330 Parkview Avenue, commonly known as the      
    Manhattan Country Club     

    City Negotiators:     
    Kevin Engstrom, Keyser Marston Associates, Inc. (KMA)    
    Talyn Mirzakhanian, City Manager    

    Negotiating Parties: The Bay Club Company    

    Under Negotiation: Price and terms of payment.


2) CONFERENCE WITH LEGAL COUNSEL (EXISTING LITIGATION)    
    (Government Code Section 54956.9(d)(1))    

    Name of Case: Manhattan Beach Firefighters' Association, Local 3925,    
    a Labor Association, et al. v City of Manhattan Beach                                                                                 
    United States District Court District of California                        

    Case No: 24-4228

II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:02 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:05 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with all City Councilmembers present. \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Attorney Quinn Barrow announced that the City Council went into Closed Session to discuss two separate items identified on the agenda. The City Council gave direction with respect to Item 1. There was no other reportable action taken.\i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:06 PM, Mayor Franklin adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


